<title>USA: Ashland Chemical acquires UK's Fospur.</title>
<headline>Ashland Chemical acquires UK's Fospur.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashland Chemical Co, a division of Ashland Inc, said Friday it has acquired Fospur Ltd, a water treatment company based in the United Kingdom, from Yorkshire Environmental Ltd.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not announced.</p>
<p>The boiler water treatment, cooling water treatment and waste water treatment business will become part of Ashland Chemical's Drew Industrial Division.  The acquisition includes personnel, accounts, a manufacturing facility, laboratories, product line, and equipment.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
